WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 7]

01:49.400 --> 01:50.060
Master.

01:52.960 --> 01:53.940
What unruly creature dares

01:53.990 --> 01:55.040
to cause trouble here?

01:56.180 --> 01:56.940
We'd better move.

01:57.030 --> 01:58.650
If we don't leave now, a Core Formation cultivator might show up.

01:59.160 --> 01:59.620
Yes, sir.

02:04.550 --> 02:06.210
You're spared for now.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.520
How could such a fiend

02:13.520 --> 02:15.050
appear among rogue cultivators?

02:16.390 --> 02:18.260
Could this be the work of those demonic sects again?

02:21.670 --> 02:22.370
That young man

02:22.560 --> 02:23.370
should count his blessings.

02:29.640 --> 02:30.540
I've been saved.

02:30.960 --> 02:32.540
A high-level cultivator must have stepped in.

02:38.520 --> 02:40.020
I escaped by the skin of my teeth.

02:41.150 --> 02:42.210
It seems being a rogue cultivator means hardship

02:42.430 --> 02:43.210
at every turn.

02:44.510 --> 02:45.820
If I want to survive,

02:46.510 --> 02:47.330
I'll have to join

02:47.790 --> 02:48.660
a worthy sect.

03:01.310 --> 03:01.900
What's going on?

03:02.480 --> 03:03.770
Where is Wu Jiuzhi's body?

03:04.200 --> 03:04.900
It's gone.

03:49.020 --> 03:50.460
[Tomb of Wan Xiaoshan]

03:50.460 --> 03:54.940
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream...♪

03:55.800 --> 03:57.060
Let me tell you something, Han.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.980
When it comes to cultivation in the Yue Kingdom,

03:59.080 --> 04:00.690
I know everything there is to know.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.730
Ask me anything you want.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.660
I learned a lot from you yesterday.

04:04.840 --> 04:06.450
We rogue cultivators are like one big family.

04:06.590 --> 04:08.570
Living free and easy as a rogue cultivator for life

04:08.710 --> 04:09.690
doesn't sound so bad.

04:09.900 --> 04:15.420
♪Too hard to forget, easier just to miss♪

04:17.260 --> 04:21.820
♪They say the past fades like smoke...♪

04:24.430 --> 04:25.380
[Qingniu Town, Wuligou Village]
Once I reach Yellow Maple Valley,

04:25.840 --> 04:27.170
[Han Li's Home]
I will leave behind the world of mortals.

04:28.150 --> 04:29.170
Worldly ties

04:29.310 --> 04:30.500
will no longer concern me.

04:31.840 --> 04:32.730
Before I go,

04:33.470 --> 04:34.780
I should head home one last time.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.100
The third uncle came.

04:38.150 --> 04:39.820
He's here to take you to the Seven Mysteries Sect entrance exam.

04:40.030 --> 04:41.170
Father borrowed three big bowls of noodles

04:41.240 --> 04:41.820
from the sixth uncle,

04:41.960 --> 04:43.010
Madam Zheng,

04:43.120 --> 04:44.170
and Gousheng's families, just to send you off.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.410
He even had me pull up some scallions.

04:45.910 --> 04:46.660
Before I knew it,

04:47.840 --> 04:49.730
Xiaomei was already of marrying age.

04:52.520 --> 04:53.060
Father.

04:54.000 --> 04:54.450
Mother.

05:00.520 --> 05:00.820
Li,

05:00.960 --> 05:02.380
do you think you can pass the Seven Mysteries Sect exam?

05:04.240 --> 05:04.780
Yes.

05:05.190 --> 05:06.130
I'll definitely pass.

05:06.750 --> 05:08.730
My brother said he'll pass the exam!

05:08.750 --> 05:09.940
My eldest grandson will surely make it.

05:09.960 --> 05:11.170
Without a doubt.

05:15.500 --> 05:18.100
♪Time will fade♪

05:18.740 --> 05:20.940
♪All the words ever spoken♪

05:22.500 --> 05:25.500
♪Only this longing remains♪

05:26.060 --> 05:31.100
♪Crossing centuries and days...♪

05:31.120 --> 05:31.610
Grandfather.

05:32.190 --> 05:32.570
Brother.

05:33.150 --> 05:33.690
Xiaomei.

05:35.080 --> 05:35.890
I'm glad I got to see you all

05:36.470 --> 05:37.290
before I set off

05:38.150 --> 05:38.690
on this long journey.

05:41.660 --> 05:44.740
[Moonshadow Sect, Celestial Moon Ark]

05:48.710 --> 05:50.450
I pluck a piece of cloud to send home,

05:50.840 --> 05:51.820
to let them know I am safe.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.780
Show-off.

06:09.040 --> 06:09.580
Yan Ruyan!

06:09.630 --> 06:10.700
What's wrong?

06:11.000 --> 06:11.580
Yan Ruyan!

06:19.480 --> 06:20.780
The entrance to Yellow Maple Valley

06:21.000 --> 06:22.250
should be around here.

06:22.950 --> 06:24.050
Where exactly is it?

06:31.160 --> 06:31.810
Come back!

06:41.070 --> 06:41.580
Come back!

06:44.560 --> 06:45.220
Get back here!

07:12.180 --> 07:14.540
[Yellow Maple Valley]

07:20.160 --> 07:21.170
A sky full of yellow maple leaves.

07:22.510 --> 07:22.930
Is this

07:23.720 --> 07:24.780
Yellow Maple Valley?

09:35.560 --> 09:36.290
What's this?

09:50.100 --> 09:51.700
[Wu Xuan, Liu Jing]

09:51.700 --> 09:53.460
[Song Meng, Zhong Weiniang]

09:56.160 --> 09:56.980
That's

09:58.510 --> 09:59.290
mine...

10:04.870 --> 10:05.540
Fu Yunzi.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.370
Remember these tiles?

10:08.370 --> 10:09.000
[Fu Yunzi, Clear Void Sect]

10:09.000 --> 10:09.980
Show-off.

10:10.270 --> 10:10.980
Is today not the day

10:11.000 --> 10:12.250
new disciples are admitted?

10:12.960 --> 10:13.650
Shouldn't you be somewhere else

10:13.870 --> 10:15.650
rather than playing mahjong here?

10:15.980 --> 10:16.550
[Li Huayuan, Yellow Maple Valley]

10:16.550 --> 10:17.420
Of course.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.730
But you know the rules

10:19.870 --> 10:21.250
of Yellow Maple Valley.

10:21.510 --> 10:23.740
When it is time for new disciples to enter,

10:23.740 --> 10:25.010
I open betting pools.

10:25.750 --> 10:28.580
It helps liven things up, you know?

10:29.040 --> 10:31.750
Of course. Absolutely.

10:31.750 --> 10:33.180
You came at the right time.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.460
The first round

10:37.000 --> 10:38.220
shall begin now.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.650
Great!

10:40.870 --> 10:41.410
Here.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.730
Left is odd.

10:45.120 --> 10:45.980
Right is even.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.700
Place your bets. No changes after this.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.300
Come on.

10:48.320 --> 10:49.610
A hundred-year lingzhi.

10:50.240 --> 10:50.730
I bet on odd.

10:51.240 --> 10:51.980
Odd for me too.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.610
Me too.

10:54.320 --> 10:54.770
I bet on even.

10:55.910 --> 10:56.300
Here.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.300
Wouldn't want you to say I cheated.

11:00.510 --> 11:01.100
Show us the results.

11:04.080 --> 11:04.650
One.

11:05.080 --> 11:05.610
Two.

11:05.910 --> 11:06.650
Five.

11:06.870 --> 11:07.490
Six.

11:07.870 --> 11:08.490
Seven.

11:08.960 --> 11:09.610
Eight.

11:10.030 --> 11:11.010
16.

11:12.510 --> 11:13.250
16 is even, right?

11:13.600 --> 11:14.250
Is 16 even?

11:14.390 --> 11:14.980
Yes, Grandmaster.

11:15.030 --> 11:16.010
It is even!

11:16.240 --> 11:16.650
Collect them!

11:17.600 --> 11:18.370
Collect them all!

11:18.670 --> 11:19.580
My talisman!

11:20.440 --> 11:21.100
Take them.

11:21.120 --> 11:21.890
What's all the fuss about?

11:23.080 --> 11:24.100
There are wins and losses

11:24.120 --> 11:25.580
in gambling.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.100
That's right.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.220
Accept your loss.

11:27.240 --> 11:27.650
Don't be a sore loser.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.180
Good.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.010
Huayuan,

11:29.360 --> 11:29.850
boys,

11:30.150 --> 11:30.530
we will end here

11:30.670 --> 11:31.300
for today.

11:31.510 --> 11:32.370
I bid you goodbye.

11:33.000 --> 11:33.890
Mentor Fu Yunzi.

11:34.000 --> 11:34.730
Liu.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.010
Master,

11:36.360 --> 11:37.340
I have something important to report.

11:38.480 --> 11:39.060
What is it?

11:39.390 --> 11:40.190
A young man holding

11:40.200 --> 11:41.460
an Ascension Token has arrived in the valley.

11:42.790 --> 11:43.460
Ascension Token?

11:44.460 --> 11:45.910
[Token]

11:45.910 --> 11:47.700
I haven't seen this thing in over 400 or 500 years.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.370
Indeed.

11:49.510 --> 11:51.060
This is a rare item.

11:51.390 --> 11:51.940
Indeed.

11:52.200 --> 11:52.610
This...

11:56.550 --> 11:57.130
Wait a minute.

11:58.030 --> 11:59.180
How many were there just now?

11:59.270 --> 12:00.460
- 16. - 16.

12:00.630 --> 12:01.460
Add this one

12:01.550 --> 12:01.890
and...

12:04.030 --> 12:05.010
What's

12:05.240 --> 12:05.770
16 plus 1?

12:07.200 --> 12:07.850
18.

12:09.000 --> 12:09.980
Fu Yunzi.

12:10.320 --> 12:11.300
I have seen cheating,

12:11.320 --> 12:12.490
but never someone this shameless!

12:12.510 --> 12:13.580
Isn't it 18?

12:13.600 --> 12:14.730
It's 17!

12:14.850 --> 12:16.220
Give me that!

12:16.670 --> 12:17.060
Get it!

12:17.120 --> 12:17.890
Hurry!

12:18.000 --> 12:18.370
Quickly!

12:18.790 --> 12:19.770
Whose is this?

12:19.790 --> 12:21.100
- Oh, you. - My talisman!

12:21.630 --> 12:22.490
This token

12:22.670 --> 12:23.820
couldn't have come at a better time.

12:24.510 --> 12:25.490
I'll remember you.

12:25.750 --> 12:26.850
This is yours.

12:26.870 --> 12:27.580
Hold up.

12:27.910 --> 12:28.580
My talisman.

12:29.200 --> 12:29.580
Where is he?

12:30.200 --> 12:31.010
At the bottom of the north valley.

12:51.510 --> 12:52.060
Mentor.

12:52.390 --> 12:52.940
What precious possessions

12:53.270 --> 12:54.250
have you brought today?

12:54.340 --> 12:56.660
[Hongfu, Yellow Maple Valley]

12:56.870 --> 12:57.770
[Zhong Lingdao, Yellow Maple Valley Sect Master]
Snow Mountain Ice Lotus.

12:58.600 --> 13:00.610
Paired with hundred-year banana leaf you brought,

13:00.870 --> 13:01.940
it balances cold and heat.

13:02.080 --> 13:02.730
Nourishes the spirit root.

13:03.720 --> 13:04.180
Excellent.

13:05.240 --> 13:05.890
Wu.

13:06.440 --> 13:07.250
What about you?

13:07.870 --> 13:10.100
[Wu Mian, Yellow Maple Valley]
What I brought is nothing

13:10.200 --> 13:11.940
compared to what you all have.

13:14.630 --> 13:15.490
That's a fine item.

13:15.550 --> 13:16.610
Nine Heavens Mystic Cicada.

13:17.270 --> 13:18.300
Gentlest of all.

13:19.550 --> 13:20.300
Please.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.180
What tea are we having today?

13:27.630 --> 13:28.530
Let's enjoy some fine tea.

13:33.360 --> 13:33.850
Allow me.

13:34.750 --> 13:35.250
Watch this.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.010
Excellent tea.

13:44.790 --> 13:45.300
Enjoy.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.220
Having tea without me?

13:53.550 --> 13:54.580
Here comes the tea moocher.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.460
Quick! Finish the tea!

13:59.390 --> 14:01.010
I hope the tea scalds you,

14:01.030 --> 14:02.370
you money-grubber.

14:02.550 --> 14:03.710
Who says I am mooching tea?

14:05.360 --> 14:05.650
Look.

14:06.960 --> 14:08.700
I brought something.

14:09.360 --> 14:10.280
A hundred-year spirit herb.

14:10.840 --> 14:11.730
Excellent choice.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.340
Hongfu,

14:15.670 --> 14:16.730
I brought it just for you.

14:18.750 --> 14:19.300
Everyone,

14:20.240 --> 14:22.920
today Yellow Maple Valley welcomes a rare guest,

14:23.080 --> 14:25.100
someone who's the likes of whom we haven't encountered in a hundred years.

14:25.750 --> 14:26.060
Come

14:26.360 --> 14:26.890
and have a look at this.

14:27.030 --> 14:27.460
What is it?

14:32.120 --> 14:33.610
I'm Song Meng, a Foundation Establishment disciple

14:33.720 --> 14:34.250
of Yellow Maple Valley.

14:34.550 --> 14:35.490
This is my sixth junior brother,

14:35.600 --> 14:36.060
Wu Xuan,

14:36.440 --> 14:37.060
and this is our seventh junior sister.

14:37.150 --> 14:38.850
So he is the one who brought the Ascension Token?

14:39.440 --> 14:40.130
That is right.

14:44.150 --> 14:44.650
What is your name?

14:46.960 --> 14:47.820
My name is Han Li.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.300
Why is he here?

14:53.960 --> 14:55.310
That guy has

14:56.000 --> 14:56.960
the Ascension Token?

14:57.320 --> 14:58.420
That guy?

14:59.200 --> 14:59.830
No way.

15:00.790 --> 15:01.970
Someone with a fake spirit root

15:01.970 --> 15:03.530
couldn't possibly have an Ascension Token.

15:05.120 --> 15:07.010
They say anyone who enters with an Ascension Token

15:07.630 --> 15:09.060
receives a Foundation Pill by default.

15:09.630 --> 15:10.220
Why?

15:11.670 --> 15:12.610
Because their ancestors rendered great service

15:12.720 --> 15:13.460
in the past.

15:15.480 --> 15:17.980
He doesn't look like someone from a meritorious bloodline.

15:18.790 --> 15:19.650
A mere mortal

15:19.790 --> 15:20.580
trying to sneak into the cultivation world.

15:20.630 --> 15:21.940
Their ancestors did great service?

15:22.000 --> 15:23.940
Cultivation clans use their most precious resources

15:24.000 --> 15:25.420
on their own descendants.

15:25.960 --> 15:26.650
Even I had

15:26.670 --> 15:28.340
to fight for my life at Tianwu Arena just to earn

15:28.390 --> 15:29.980
the right to a Foundation Pill.

15:30.510 --> 15:31.340
What gives him

15:32.030 --> 15:32.940
the right?

15:34.120 --> 15:34.580
Enough.

15:35.360 --> 15:36.650
We are here to cultivate,

15:37.240 --> 15:38.130
so let us focus on that.

15:38.790 --> 15:39.650
Do not judge others.

15:40.150 --> 15:40.610
Understood.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.100
Got it.

15:41.120 --> 15:41.940
Qiaoqian is right.

15:42.720 --> 15:43.940
We came here to become cultivators,

15:44.270 --> 15:45.010
unlike someone

15:45.200 --> 15:46.490
who came to be a toad lusting after a swan.

15:46.870 --> 15:47.340
Right.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.010
Pay no mind to their comments.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.240
Four of the five elements spirit roots,

15:57.790 --> 15:58.650
all at once.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.730
You could not ask for worse.

16:01.030 --> 16:01.650
Indeed.

16:02.000 --> 16:03.060
And a fake spirit root at that.

16:04.510 --> 16:05.250
Indeed.

16:05.720 --> 16:06.610
Which clan would waste

16:06.840 --> 16:07.580
an Ascension Token

16:08.320 --> 16:10.340
on someone this useless?

16:11.550 --> 16:12.650
If I remember correctly,

16:12.670 --> 16:14.650
sect rule 23 states that anyone bearing the Ascension Token

16:14.910 --> 16:16.580
must be accepted

16:17.200 --> 16:18.100
without questioning

16:18.600 --> 16:20.370
their background or aptitude.

16:21.630 --> 16:22.180
That is right.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.940
And by the rules,

16:24.670 --> 16:26.220
he should be given one Foundation Pill as well.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.180
What?

16:27.750 --> 16:28.770
Giving him a Foundation Pill

16:29.200 --> 16:30.010
is such a waste.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.490
What about my disciples then?

16:36.080 --> 16:37.650
Yellow Maple Valley has already done him a huge favor

16:37.670 --> 16:39.180
by accepting this fake spirit root.

16:39.390 --> 16:40.700
Must we give him a Foundation Pill too?

16:41.240 --> 16:42.220
What is owed must be given.

16:42.960 --> 16:44.980
We can't break the rules over one pill.

16:45.080 --> 16:45.460
Indeed.

16:45.600 --> 16:46.530
If word gets out,

16:46.550 --> 16:48.100
we'll become the target of mockery from the other six sects.

16:48.270 --> 16:48.770
Indeed.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.010
He's right.

16:51.510 --> 16:53.120
Regardless of his talent,

16:53.600 --> 16:54.220
he should be accepted

16:54.670 --> 16:55.460
into the sect.

16:55.800 --> 16:56.400
The Foundation Pill should

16:56.400 --> 16:57.130
be given too.

16:58.080 --> 16:58.770
However...

17:00.320 --> 17:00.820
However what?

17:01.510 --> 17:02.490
The Foundation Pill quota

17:02.960 --> 17:04.820
is set in advance every year.

17:05.080 --> 17:07.370
This year, we only prepared one, for the champion

17:07.390 --> 17:08.300
of the Tainan Bazaar.

17:08.790 --> 17:09.730
If we give it to this newcomer,

17:10.000 --> 17:10.610
then the champion

17:10.840 --> 17:11.530
will not get one.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.060
Then so be it.

17:15.480 --> 17:16.770
My suggestion is

17:17.000 --> 17:19.340
that we temporarily replace it with gems.

17:19.600 --> 17:20.610
After all, the champion

17:20.630 --> 17:22.130
will surely qualify next year.

17:23.840 --> 17:24.180
Well.

17:24.200 --> 17:24.820
It's settled then.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.250
It's settled then.

17:29.000 --> 17:29.460
Wu,

17:29.870 --> 17:30.340
go

17:30.510 --> 17:31.420
and welcome him into the valley.

17:32.480 --> 17:33.890
Yes, Sect Master.

17:35.030 --> 17:35.460
Hongu.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.340
Please.

17:37.030 --> 17:37.980
You brat,

17:38.320 --> 17:40.890
I just repaid that gambling favor earlier.

17:41.790 --> 17:42.490
Let's have some tea.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.180
Come.

17:44.390 --> 17:45.460
Lovely tea.

17:47.750 --> 17:48.370
Sect Master Zhong,

17:48.670 --> 17:49.530
where's my cup?

17:50.510 --> 17:51.180
Here you go.

17:52.510 --> 17:53.940
No tea for latecomers.

17:56.670 --> 17:57.700
The tea's rather ordinary.

18:02.030 --> 18:02.650
It's good.

18:03.750 --> 18:04.180
There's more.

18:05.000 --> 18:05.530
Really?

18:11.910 --> 18:12.460
Senior Wu.

18:15.550 --> 18:16.420
Senior Wu.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.250
You are the one

18:25.340 --> 18:26.440
who brought the Ascension Token?

18:26.550 --> 18:27.050
Yes.

18:27.860 --> 18:28.480
My name is Han Li.

18:30.790 --> 18:32.130
The Ascension Token is a rare item.

18:32.860 --> 18:33.930
Even I have never seen one before.

18:34.740 --> 18:36.130
How did you come by it?

18:39.190 --> 18:40.240
It was passed down from my ancestors.

18:40.670 --> 18:42.200
Are you perhaps from a cultivation clan?

18:42.630 --> 18:44.090
Or do you have a senior family member

18:44.350 --> 18:45.720
working in one of the seven sects?

18:50.060 --> 18:51.240
I come from the mortal world.

18:51.830 --> 18:53.040
I am not from a cultivation clan.

18:57.910 --> 18:58.370
No matter.

18:59.350 --> 19:00.200
The Ascension Token is rare.

19:01.300 --> 19:03.570
The fact that you received one means you have fate with Yellow Maple Valley.

19:04.740 --> 19:05.410
My surname is Wu.

19:05.980 --> 19:06.810
From now on,

19:07.220 --> 19:08.440
you may call me Mentor Wu.

19:13.060 --> 19:13.760
Welcome

19:14.260 --> 19:15.130
to Yellow Maple Valley.

19:35.430 --> 19:36.130
I am

19:38.060 --> 19:38.650
officially

19:38.830 --> 19:39.370
a disciple

19:39.910 --> 19:40.650
of Yellow Maple Valley

19:41.430 --> 19:42.410
now.

19:59.350 --> 20:00.240
Thank you, Mentor Wu.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.040
For today,

20:06.260 --> 20:07.280
I will act as your guide

20:07.980 --> 20:08.850
and help you

20:09.260 --> 20:09.930
understand

20:10.430 --> 20:11.960
the basic rules of the valley.

20:12.870 --> 20:13.280
Follow me.

20:26.950 --> 20:27.410
Mentor,

20:27.630 --> 20:28.370
watch your step.

20:29.910 --> 20:30.680
That is the Qianji Library.

20:31.110 --> 20:33.090
It holds basic cultivation manuals and alchemy recipes.

20:33.590 --> 20:34.930
You can borrow them by paying gems.

20:35.020 --> 20:35.440
I also

20:35.630 --> 20:36.890
work there.

20:39.000 --> 20:39.780
To the west is where

20:39.780 --> 20:41.280
Qi Refining Stage disciples live.

20:41.780 --> 20:43.280
Aside from being hot like a steam furnace,

20:43.280 --> 20:44.610
it is not too bad.

20:45.190 --> 20:46.410
If you have enough gems,

20:46.430 --> 20:47.570
you can apply to move to the rear mountain,

20:47.670 --> 20:49.090
where the accommodation is better.

20:50.460 --> 20:51.040
Move aside.

20:59.150 --> 20:59.720
Otherwise,

20:59.830 --> 21:00.960
you will have to wait until you reach the Foundation Establishment,

21:00.980 --> 21:01.650
Thank you.

21:01.830 --> 21:03.170
and establish your personal abode.

21:03.590 --> 21:04.960
There are many things that require gems in the valley.

21:05.350 --> 21:06.960
How can I earn them?

21:08.630 --> 21:10.200
You can go to Baiji Hall and take on tasks

21:10.390 --> 21:11.240
to earn gems.

21:11.950 --> 21:12.890
What kind of tasks?

21:13.350 --> 21:14.000
Tasks such as

21:14.000 --> 21:15.590
caring for spirit beasts in the valley,

21:16.110 --> 21:18.040
supervising mining operations at the quarries,

21:18.500 --> 21:19.040
or instructing new disciples

21:19.150 --> 21:20.110
in basic techniques

21:20.110 --> 21:21.650
at the Chuangong Pavilion.

21:22.190 --> 21:22.930
Each task pays a different amount

21:23.110 --> 21:24.810
depending on its difficulty.

21:26.060 --> 21:27.520
Baiji Hall is overseen by Mentor Ye.

21:28.060 --> 21:29.410
He has a rather eccentric temperament,

21:29.780 --> 21:30.720
so stay sharp around him.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.480
This is the Alchemy Room.

21:41.740 --> 21:43.000
Once you've saved up enough gems,

21:43.110 --> 21:43.720
you can come here.

22:10.910 --> 22:11.410
Ye.

22:11.870 --> 22:13.370
What are you doing so early in the morning?

22:13.740 --> 22:14.720
I brought a new disciple

22:14.830 --> 22:16.090
to pick up his entry supplies.

22:16.830 --> 22:17.650
Didn't someone just come earlier?

22:17.670 --> 22:18.330
Why are we doing this again?

22:18.870 --> 22:20.090
Greetings, Mentor Ye.

22:23.630 --> 22:24.930
You must be the one with the Ascension Token?

22:25.110 --> 22:26.200
Even you've heard about it.

22:26.700 --> 22:27.810
These youngsters

22:28.260 --> 22:29.200
have no interest in learning,

22:29.350 --> 22:31.090
but they are all experts when it comes to gossip.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.960
You may not have much talent,

22:39.740 --> 22:40.810
but you sure are lucky.

22:47.060 --> 22:47.850
Wait here.

23:01.460 --> 23:02.040
Don't touch anything.

23:06.460 --> 23:07.200
Come here.

23:13.810 --> 23:14.930
[Cultivation Basics]

23:16.460 --> 23:18.040
This is the Yellow Maple Valley entry token.

23:18.190 --> 23:20.170
Draw a strand of spiritual power and inject it to activate it.

23:20.500 --> 23:21.520
After that, it will be bound to you.

23:24.460 --> 23:25.480
Go ahead and infuse your spiritual power.

23:33.390 --> 23:34.760
A tenfold mystic pouch,

23:35.110 --> 23:36.200
one Cultivation Basics,

23:36.910 --> 23:38.330
a set of daily refining tools,

23:40.020 --> 23:41.760
the Solarflame Sword and Cold Moon Blade,

23:43.910 --> 23:45.730
and a yellow entry robe.

23:48.150 --> 23:49.570
You will take tasks to earn gems,

23:49.780 --> 23:50.760
and spend them on gear

23:50.780 --> 23:51.890
and tools here with me.

23:53.300 --> 23:54.720
Come back when you have more gems.

23:56.350 --> 23:57.170
Thank you, Mentor Ye.

24:09.540 --> 24:10.170
Well?

24:10.220 --> 24:11.570
Does the Yellow Maple Valley disciple's robe

24:11.590 --> 24:12.930
not look flawless?

24:13.390 --> 24:13.890
It does.

24:14.430 --> 24:15.330
It is the first time in my life

24:15.430 --> 24:17.330
I have seen a robe without stitching.

24:21.630 --> 24:22.040
Walk with me.

24:23.950 --> 24:25.130
That is about all you need to know

24:25.630 --> 24:26.520
about the valley for now.

24:28.260 --> 24:28.930
According to sect rules,

24:29.430 --> 24:31.040
anyone entering with an Ascension Token is to receive

24:31.430 --> 24:32.930
a Foundation Pill in advance.

24:34.190 --> 24:34.680
This one

24:35.190 --> 24:35.930
is yours.

24:38.220 --> 24:38.810
Take it.

24:40.950 --> 24:41.610
A word of advice.

24:41.980 --> 24:43.040
There are many

24:43.220 --> 24:44.090
who covet Foundation Pills.

24:44.430 --> 24:45.650
Keep it safe.

24:46.060 --> 24:46.960
If you lose it,

24:47.390 --> 24:48.930
no amount of gems will get you another.

24:53.060 --> 24:53.760
Thank you, Mentor.

24:55.060 --> 24:55.760
I am responsible

24:55.780 --> 24:57.720
for teaching the disciples basic cultivation techniques.

24:58.190 --> 25:00.440
If you ever encounter difficulty in your cultivation,

25:00.780 --> 25:01.760
come find me anytime.

25:03.830 --> 25:04.440
I will never forget your guidance

25:04.980 --> 25:05.930
when I succeed

25:06.740 --> 25:08.570
in reaching the Foundation Establishment.

25:08.980 --> 25:10.610
Don't worry about Foundation Establishment just yet.

25:15.350 --> 25:17.410
Regardless of whether you succeed,

25:18.260 --> 25:19.200
this pill must be

25:19.460 --> 25:20.480
carefully safeguarded.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.040
I'll remember that.

25:23.460 --> 25:24.090
Thank you.

25:24.220 --> 25:25.240
Hurry back to your quarters.

25:28.190 --> 25:29.890
Even if they gave me a Foundation Pill,

25:30.460 --> 25:31.680
with a fake spirit root like mine,

25:32.150 --> 25:33.520
I'll never reach the Foundation Establishment.

25:34.670 --> 25:35.850
That must be

25:36.350 --> 25:37.130
what he meant.

26:22.390 --> 26:24.040
Don't give me that look.

26:26.020 --> 26:26.930
Wasted on the undeserving.

26:28.740 --> 26:29.890
Like giving a lamp to a blind man.

26:30.110 --> 26:30.930
An absolute waste of resources.

27:00.430 --> 27:01.650
Look at that snow. So white.

27:23.950 --> 27:25.040
Hey, it's Ascension Token!

27:25.500 --> 27:26.000
Ascension Token!

27:28.150 --> 27:28.760
My name is Han Li.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.890
"Han Li" doesn't sound nearly as impressive as "Ascension Token."

27:31.220 --> 27:32.170
Why not just rename yourself?

27:32.430 --> 27:33.410
You can be "Ascension Token" from now on.

27:34.390 --> 27:35.480
You two, that's enough.

27:45.700 --> 27:47.090
Grandmaster Hongfu.

27:51.110 --> 27:52.680
Choose a leaf you like.

28:02.700 --> 28:03.330
You will ride it

28:03.350 --> 28:04.170
through the skies.

28:06.220 --> 28:07.130
Yellow Maple Valley's expanse is such that,

28:07.350 --> 28:08.370
using just your legs,

28:08.740 --> 28:10.040
you wouldn't cover it in ten days.

28:11.060 --> 28:11.960
If you can't fly,

28:12.460 --> 28:13.280
you'll never find

28:13.590 --> 28:14.480
your place here.

28:15.870 --> 28:17.370
Most of you have only taken flight

28:17.830 --> 28:19.200
in your dreams.

28:20.540 --> 28:21.240
Some are too timid

28:22.220 --> 28:23.720
to even dare dream of flying.

28:24.590 --> 28:25.280
Those people

28:25.700 --> 28:26.680
will never leave the ground.

28:27.220 --> 28:28.410
Cultivation begins

28:28.630 --> 28:30.680
by breaking past the limits in your heart.

28:31.500 --> 28:32.480
If the Kunpeng can soar,

28:32.910 --> 28:33.850
so can people.

28:34.220 --> 28:35.720
Harness the power of Heaven and Earth,

28:36.190 --> 28:36.680
command

28:36.780 --> 28:37.720
the six energies,

28:38.500 --> 28:39.240
and fly upon the wind

28:39.540 --> 28:40.480
through the void.

28:41.700 --> 28:42.280
Grandmaster,

28:42.700 --> 28:44.410
are you saying that if we believe,

28:44.590 --> 28:45.330
we can fly?

28:47.630 --> 28:48.890
Then what does that make us cultivators?

28:48.910 --> 28:50.810
Fools chasing dreams?

28:52.060 --> 28:53.200
Whether something is possible is one thing,

28:53.220 --> 28:54.890
but whether you can do it is another.

28:55.460 --> 28:56.200
Just because others can

28:56.500 --> 28:57.520
doesn't mean you can.

28:58.060 --> 28:58.890
Just because others cannot

28:59.500 --> 29:00.720
doesn't mean you cannot.

29:02.260 --> 29:03.330
Remain steady in both praise and shame,

29:03.830 --> 29:04.720
and let your heart guide your every move.

29:05.350 --> 29:06.410
This is the state

29:06.590 --> 29:07.720
that cultivators seek to attain.

29:10.460 --> 29:11.000
All right.

29:12.060 --> 29:12.610
I've explained

29:12.700 --> 29:13.720
what needs to be explained.

29:15.830 --> 29:17.090
Fly beyond the mountain ahead,

29:17.910 --> 29:18.760
and you will be

29:18.870 --> 29:20.330
formally inducted as disciples of Yellow Maple Valley.

29:27.630 --> 29:28.570
Any other questions?

29:29.980 --> 29:30.650
Grandmaster Hongfu,

29:30.980 --> 29:31.760
we just need

29:31.910 --> 29:32.610
to fly over the mountain.

29:32.870 --> 29:34.280
We don't need to use these leaves, do we?

29:35.630 --> 29:36.240
The choice is yours.

29:38.740 --> 29:39.960
I will be waiting on the other side.

29:42.190 --> 29:43.720
I don't need this lousy leaf!

29:44.540 --> 29:44.850
Come on!

29:45.430 --> 29:45.720
Come on!

29:45.870 --> 29:46.240
Let's go.

29:46.590 --> 29:46.960
Let's go!

31:04.630 --> 31:05.570
How did this turn into tug-of-war?

31:45.460 --> 31:46.930
Harness the power of Heaven and Earth.

31:52.630 --> 31:53.200
Command

31:54.590 --> 31:56.440
the six energies.

32:08.260 --> 32:08.930
Here I go!

32:15.910 --> 32:17.040
With the Kunpeng in my heart,

32:18.060 --> 32:19.170
I will surely take flight.

32:23.500 --> 32:24.280
This is too slow.

32:25.300 --> 32:26.370
This is no Kunpeng.

32:26.910 --> 32:28.200
This is a bug.

32:45.260 --> 32:45.720
What do you think?

32:46.910 --> 32:48.570
When did you learn this spell?

32:50.430 --> 32:52.650
While the flowers of April fade in the mortal realm,

32:53.190 --> 32:55.090
peach blossoms bloom anew at the mountain temple.

32:56.500 --> 32:57.280
It's just a small trick of mine.

32:58.870 --> 33:00.000
Don't let Xuan'er see you

33:00.020 --> 33:01.170
using this.

33:02.190 --> 33:04.040
Seeing all these flowers and plants

33:04.190 --> 33:05.370
will only distract her more from her cultivation.

33:06.670 --> 33:07.720
You're right.

33:08.220 --> 33:09.200
One moment.

33:18.300 --> 33:19.370
There.

33:19.670 --> 33:20.090
No more of that.

33:20.830 --> 33:21.810
I'll never use that again.

33:29.020 --> 33:29.520
Hongfu,

33:29.950 --> 33:31.200
why are this year's

33:31.220 --> 33:32.370
new disciples

33:32.390 --> 33:33.480
so untalented?

33:33.590 --> 33:35.090
They're the worst group I've ever seen.

33:36.300 --> 33:37.520
That's not entirely true.

33:43.630 --> 33:44.520
What about the disciple with the Ascension Token?

33:45.220 --> 33:46.240
Surely, his possession of such a rare item

33:46.830 --> 33:47.410
indicates

33:47.500 --> 33:49.000
that there is something exceptional about him.

33:50.740 --> 33:52.850
It is a waste of a Foundation Pill.

33:54.460 --> 33:56.240
Still, he is not without merit.

33:57.540 --> 33:59.240
Maybe because he knows

34:00.060 --> 34:00.610
he is mediocre,

34:01.150 --> 34:01.890
he has

34:01.950 --> 34:02.720
a good attitude

34:03.150 --> 34:04.000
and strong will.

34:10.020 --> 34:12.520
A human life is short, like trees in autumn.

34:13.700 --> 34:15.170
With talent like his,

34:15.910 --> 34:16.440
I fear

34:16.460 --> 34:17.810
he might grow old and die

34:18.630 --> 34:20.240
before he ever uses that Foundation Pill.

34:40.430 --> 34:41.240
What was that for?

34:43.300 --> 34:45.200
I gave him some wind to wield.

34:45.780 --> 34:47.650
Let us see if he is a sparrow

34:48.740 --> 34:49.570
or a great swan.

35:08.490 --> 35:09.450
♪Chasing wind♪

35:09.770 --> 35:11.810
♪I set out afar♪

35:12.050 --> 35:13.610
♪The road ahead lost♪

35:14.010 --> 35:15.290
♪My voice unheard♪

35:15.650 --> 35:17.370
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

35:17.570 --> 35:18.410
♪Laying low♪

35:18.810 --> 35:20.530
♪I plan every move♪

35:21.050 --> 35:22.490
♪With a mortal heart

35:23.010 --> 35:24.290
♪And lingering ties♪

35:24.770 --> 35:26.410
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

35:27.090 --> 35:30.050
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

35:30.450 --> 35:33.530
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

35:35.290 --> 35:38.250
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

35:39.370 --> 35:43.730
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

35:47.450 --> 35:49.050
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

35:49.330 --> 35:50.730
♪I fight alone♪

35:51.210 --> 35:53.010
♪As chaos shakes the world♪

35:56.290 --> 35:58.010
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

35:58.410 --> 35:59.770
♪Kind at heart♪

36:00.050 --> 36:01.570
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

36:02.210 --> 36:03.690
♪Forged by trial♪

36:03.890 --> 36:05.890
♪I rise through three realms♪

36:06.290 --> 36:09.650
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

36:09.870 --> 36:10.960
From today onward,

36:12.060 --> 36:13.560
you are officially disciples

36:14.180 --> 36:15.080
of Yellow Maple Valley.

36:15.980 --> 36:16.810
As your Sect Master,

36:17.100 --> 36:18.370
I have only one request.

36:19.270 --> 36:20.560
Focus on your cultivation

36:21.060 --> 36:22.210
and avoid causing trouble.

36:23.310 --> 36:24.410
Your purpose here

36:26.060 --> 36:26.690
is cultivation.

36:28.390 --> 36:29.850
The first major milestone in cultivation

36:30.270 --> 36:31.000
is the Foundation Establishment Stage.

36:32.870 --> 36:34.160
- Once you reach the Foundation Establishment... - Want some?

36:34.350 --> 36:34.690
I'm fine.

36:34.830 --> 36:35.120
Thank you.

36:35.500 --> 36:36.250
...you can absorb

36:36.580 --> 36:37.120
the essence

36:37.460 --> 36:38.930
of the sun, moon, earth, and heavens.

36:39.460 --> 36:40.370
You will no longer need to consume food

36:40.980 --> 36:41.850
or take in worldly impurities.

36:44.460 --> 36:45.040
So,

36:45.950 --> 36:46.480
even if

36:46.710 --> 36:47.960
you are still in the Qi Refining Stage,

36:48.350 --> 36:49.120
you should already

36:49.460 --> 36:50.080
begin practicing fasting.

37:11.140 --> 37:12.290
You should eat later.

37:13.540 --> 37:14.120
It's fine.

37:14.430 --> 37:15.410
I can eat

37:15.460 --> 37:16.370
while he talks.

37:25.980 --> 37:28.120
I can understand if it takes time

37:29.750 --> 37:31.210
to let go of gourmet food.

37:31.710 --> 37:33.330
But if you can't even put down a piece of flatbread,

37:34.140 --> 37:34.960
how will you ever succeed in cultivation?

37:37.020 --> 37:38.690
Who says cultivating means you can't eat?

37:39.980 --> 37:41.290
My family told me

37:41.620 --> 37:42.960
there's a Core Formation Grandmaster

37:43.180 --> 37:44.210
who loved eating.

37:44.710 --> 37:46.290
They carry all their utensils with them.

37:46.620 --> 37:47.810
What's wrong with me eating a flatbread?

37:48.020 --> 37:49.250
It's better than starving.

37:50.430 --> 37:51.480
Bad examples shouldn't be followed.

37:52.980 --> 37:54.480
Is there really a Core Formation Grandmaster

37:55.020 --> 37:55.690
that greedy?

37:56.020 --> 37:56.520
Indeed.

37:57.230 --> 37:58.370
Don't listen to his nonsense.

37:58.870 --> 37:59.960
What a joke.

38:00.950 --> 38:02.850
Is there really be such a gluttonous Core Formation cultivator?

38:07.230 --> 38:09.160
The rule of the Ascension Token was set by our ancestors.

38:09.660 --> 38:10.440
It's not something that can be changed.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.250
If you work hard and make good progress

38:12.710 --> 38:13.600
with your variant spirit root,

38:14.460 --> 38:15.370
the Valley may grant you

38:15.580 --> 38:17.410
another Foundation Pill as a reward.

38:17.750 --> 38:18.440
Another one?

38:24.620 --> 38:25.290
These 300 gems

38:25.660 --> 38:26.560
are compensation

38:27.060 --> 38:28.000
for you.

38:29.140 --> 38:29.600
Sect Master,

38:30.140 --> 38:31.560
I was the champion at the Tianwu Arena.

38:31.710 --> 38:32.520
According to sect rules,

38:32.620 --> 38:33.930
I should receive a Foundation Pill.

38:36.830 --> 38:38.480
You were simply unlucky.

38:39.270 --> 38:40.210
By the sect's rules,

38:41.390 --> 38:42.480
the Foundation Pill must go to him first.

38:43.790 --> 38:44.410
That

38:44.750 --> 38:45.930
is a rule

38:46.350 --> 38:47.290
we cannot alter.

38:49.230 --> 38:49.690
Sect Master,

38:50.020 --> 38:50.770
I cannot accept this!

38:50.870 --> 38:51.600
Enough.

38:53.430 --> 38:54.690
Just accept your loss and move on.

38:54.910 --> 38:56.410
Did you not hear what the Sect Master said?

38:56.830 --> 38:58.890
The Foundation Pill goes to the Ascension Token holder first.

38:59.180 --> 39:00.730
- But... - You are engaged

39:02.060 --> 39:03.480
to the daughter of the Chen family.

39:04.620 --> 39:07.210
The Chen family has plenty of Foundation Pills.

39:08.950 --> 39:09.520
What's the matter?

39:10.060 --> 39:11.160
Too proud to ask them for one?

39:15.580 --> 39:16.440
If you want to blame someone,

39:16.750 --> 39:18.410
blame the one with Ascension Token.

39:26.270 --> 39:26.770
Watch closely.

39:36.660 --> 39:37.730
Did everyone understand?

39:38.460 --> 39:40.040
Is there learn a specific technique you wish to learn?

39:40.460 --> 39:40.890
Mentor.

39:41.020 --> 39:42.480
- Mentor. - Mentor.

39:44.580 --> 39:45.640
You, over there, go first.

39:47.490 --> 39:50.410
♪We made a promise to reunite♪

39:51.570 --> 39:54.450
♪And walked into the unknown♪

39:56.090 --> 39:58.530
♪But now that we've met again...♪

39:58.540 --> 39:59.330
I want to learn

40:01.390 --> 40:02.210
Aura Concealment.

40:03.310 --> 40:04.480
A fake spirit root wants

40:04.830 --> 40:06.440
to learn Aura Concealment?

40:06.790 --> 40:07.520
What aura do you have to hide?

40:09.580 --> 40:10.370
Aura Concealment,

40:10.950 --> 40:11.730
as the name suggests,

40:12.430 --> 40:13.160
uses spiritual aura

40:13.460 --> 40:14.810
to isolate yourself from the outside world.

40:15.430 --> 40:15.850
If done well,

40:16.660 --> 40:18.040
it can hide

40:18.390 --> 40:19.080
your presence

40:19.950 --> 40:20.370
and actions

40:20.500 --> 40:21.440
from others.

40:21.950 --> 40:22.730
Observe.

40:25.450 --> 40:28.930
♪Never let yourself become a hollow husk of what you once were...♪

40:32.310 --> 40:32.770
What?

40:33.460 --> 40:34.120
Where is he?

40:34.950 --> 40:35.410
Where did he go?

40:36.910 --> 40:37.440
Where's Mentor Wu?

40:37.710 --> 40:38.370
He vanished in an instant.

40:38.430 --> 40:39.080
Amazing.

40:41.830 --> 40:42.250
Come.

40:42.270 --> 40:43.160
No wonder they call it Aura Concealment.

40:43.660 --> 40:44.040
Now,

40:44.790 --> 40:45.370
you give it a try.

40:45.610 --> 40:48.930
♪We're just fleeting mortals♪

40:49.570 --> 40:53.130
♪Time slipped by before we knew♪

40:53.770 --> 40:57.170
♪Yet we burn that spark of light♪

40:57.930 --> 41:01.290
♪Into this starry sky♪

41:01.930 --> 41:05.410
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way...♪

41:07.310 --> 41:08.440
He didn't conceal anything.

41:08.460 --> 41:09.480
What did you even conceal?

41:12.100 --> 41:12.890
Mentor Ye.

41:15.140 --> 41:15.930
Today's lesson

41:17.270 --> 41:18.250
is on talisman crafting.

41:18.450 --> 41:21.890
♪Each step of fate's game unclear♪

41:22.850 --> 41:26.090
♪Who can guess the ending?♪

41:26.530 --> 41:30.170
♪But my heart has never rested♪

41:30.770 --> 41:33.770
♪Ever chasing, still searching on...♪

41:33.830 --> 41:34.440
Give it a try.

41:34.930 --> 41:38.370
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

41:39.130 --> 41:42.490
♪How do I choose the way?♪

41:43.170 --> 41:46.610
♪Now we part, so far apart♪

41:47.210 --> 41:50.730
♪We walk our separate paths♪

42:26.170 --> 42:30.250
♪Just as I rise to compete, the years have already fled...♪

42:30.830 --> 42:32.690
The morning glow really does feel better than the evening glow.

42:35.170 --> 42:38.490
♪To be one who stands tall between heaven and earth♪

42:39.090 --> 42:42.650
♪Never let yourself become a hollow husk of what you once were♪

42:57.570 --> 43:02.890
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:04.130 --> 43:09.530
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:09.650 --> 43:12.850
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:13.090 --> 43:15.330
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:15.730 --> 43:18.570
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:19.090 --> 43:23.050
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:23.890 --> 43:29.370
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:30.530 --> 43:35.810
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:36.410 --> 43:39.450
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:39.730 --> 43:41.850
♪Swept away by time♪

43:42.490 --> 43:45.130
♪Eyes once looked far♪

43:45.610 --> 43:49.570
♪Now lost in the shift♪

43:50.050 --> 43:52.890
♪Autumn winds stir♪

43:53.170 --> 43:55.090
♪Smoke curls once more♪

43:55.530 --> 43:57.970
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

43:58.290 --> 44:01.810
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:02.370 --> 44:05.330
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:05.650 --> 44:08.570
♪Time lost its name♪

44:08.970 --> 44:11.810
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:12.210 --> 44:15.770
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:16.130 --> 44:18.970
♪The world has changed♪

44:19.370 --> 44:21.210
♪Beyond recall♪

44:21.770 --> 44:23.490
♪Time will fade♪

44:23.890 --> 44:28.690
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:29.370 --> 44:32.250
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:32.730 --> 44:38.010
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:39.130 --> 44:45.770
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:46.250 --> 44:55.970
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
